== Effects ==
* Upon use, Isaac throws a black hole that lands on the ground and forcefully sucks in enemies and their shots, which lasts for about 6 seconds.
** It deals 0.4 damage per tick very rapidly to enemies in the area, for a maximum of 6 damage per second.
** Isaac and pickups are slightly sucked towards the black hole.
** Nearby [[obstacle]]s are occasionally destroyed by the black hole.

== Notes ==
* Black Hole cannot free {{e|Sticky Nickel}}s, kill {{e|Shopkeeper}}s, or destroy [[Angel|Angels Statues]].
* Black Hole has the strongest pulling effect in the game, and will override the pulling force of {{i|Strange Attractor}}, {{t|Super Magnet}}, {{i|Ocular Rift}}, and {{i|Lodestone}}.
* Black Hole can't open {{r|Secret Room}} and {{r|Super Secret Room}}s regardless of placement, despite crushing obstacles.
* Black Hole does not suck in stationary or invincible enemies.
